---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Project from "../components/Project.astro";
const pageTitle = "Projects";
---
<BaseLayout {pageTitle}>
  <p>
    My projects are hosted on GitHub. For a VCS, I started with git (using
    GitHub Desktop 💩). I transitioned to interacting with git solely through
    the command line. I won't pretend I know how to use git like crazy. I've
    since been introduced to (and really enjoy) jujutsu (hereafter referred to
    as "jj").
  </p>
  <Project
    name="Blackjack"
    href="https://github.com/DemetriusSemanko/Blackjack"
    desc="I tried my best to recreate the game of blackjack. While I originally
          took a crack at it in Java, I am actively working on a Python
          implementation."
  />
</BaseLayout>
